The Common-Ion Effect
In pure water, the solubility of CuCl is 1.1 × 10−3 mol/L. Remember that
you calculated the solubility of CuCl in ocean water to be 2.2 × 10−6 mol/L
in Sample Problem D. So, CuCl is 500 times less soluble in sea water than
